const BRIEF = (theme, issues, extra) => `${PRE}
Theme '${theme}': issues ${issues}. For each: read the body and every comment (gh issue view N --comments), the code, tests, docs (docs/design/0006, 0007, docs/adr/0009, docs/roadmap.md) it names, and test its claims against current origin/main. Classify done | partial | open | needs-ruling with concrete evidence, the precise remaining work, whether an agent can do it without a ruling, a priority (1 = blocks the epic gate, 3 = nice to have), and the files a fix would touch (so the orchestrator can decide parallel vs serial). Note dependencies between issues and any design ambiguity that needs a human ruling. ${extra}`
